# Claude Code Handover

The archived Claude session was reconciled with the codebase on 2026-08-13. Current code remains authoritative.

## Durable completed work

- Product pivoted from admin-created Events to host-created Tables with request/approval joining.
- Tables support editing before start, completion, transactional seats, invites, chat, unread state, reactions, photos, reviews, saves, and featured content.
- Social features include connections, DMs, public profiles, search, presence, notifications, report/block, and admin moderation.
- Public identity migrated to unique `@username`; private account fields were removed from public serializers.
- Venue search uses an authenticated server-side Photon proxy and fills address/coordinates.
- Maps use MapLibre/OSM; production application startup no longer runs Prisma migrations.

## Current unfinished work

- Paid Table checkout is not implemented.
- Production OTP delivery and automated identity verification remain provider-dependent.
- Table-focused browser coverage is missing; old Events e2e scripts are stale.
- Search, mutual-friend counts, some social-link UI, and mobile navigation remain partial.
- Dormant Events/bookings/matching code still needs an explicit future retirement decision.

## Superseded history

- Events-first web routes, instant join/pay, and algorithmic matching are not the current web product.
- Phone OTP is obsolete; login uses email OTP.
- Cookie-only web auth is obsolete in current code; web presently uses bearer JWT/localStorage.
- Coral, green, Syne, Manrope, Plus Jakarta, and Mapbox directions are obsolete.
- Running migrations during Render startup is obsolete and previously caused deployment lock failures.
- Historical “all tests green” statements are snapshots, not current guarantees.

Never copy raw archive content, credentials, account identifiers, or personal data into code, rules, issues, or responses.

